      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Entorpecido. Magma a quase 1.200 °C circula pelo corpo de Numel. Quando ele esfria, o magma endurece e seus movimentos ficam mais lentos. A substância flamejante armazenada na corcova de suas costas é a fonte de seu enorme poder.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Numel pode evoluir para Camerupt no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Focus Energy</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Bulldoze, Magnitude</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Flame Burst, Incinerate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Amnesia</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Lava Plume</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Earth Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Double-Edge, Flamethrower</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Amnesia, Attract, Body Press, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Charm, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Flash Cannon, Frustration, Heat Crash, Heat Wave, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Iron Head, Lash Out, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Nature Power, Overheat, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Scorching Sands, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Will-O- Wisp, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ancient Power, Body Slam, Defense Curl, Endure, Growth, Heat Wave, Heavy Slam, Howl, Iron Head, Mud Bomb, Rollout, Scary Face, Spit Up, Stockpile, Stomp, Swallow, Yawn</p>",
